btrfs-rootfs-image(1) -- Embedded Development Infrastructure BTRFS Rootfs Tools
===============================================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`btrfs-rootfs-image`

## DESCRIPTION

Mender update module script that deals with btrfs subvolumes and subvolume increments.

